# Harness runtime state created when interlinked hooks fire with cwd=cloud/.
# Pure runtime cruft (sessions, logs, pids, a local config that may hold a
# token) — never commit it. Mirrors the root repo's .interlinked carve-out:
# only the committed package-allowlist.json is tracked.
.interlinked/*
!.interlinked/package-allowlist.json
